Package: sharding-demo
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Vlad Ananyev <vlananyev@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/nexusriot/sharding_demo
Description: Distributed sharding & replication PoC (Go port)
 Single-host PoC demonstrating modulo sharding, consistent-hashing
 with virtual nodes, health-aware replica selection, N/R/W quorums
 with read-repair, and Merkle anti-entropy. Ships two binaries:
   sharding-demo      - non-interactive walkthrough printed to stdout
   sharding-demo-tui  - bubbletea live dashboard of the ring & replicas
